# --- General Files to Ignore ---

# macOS system files
**/.DS_Store
**/*._*

# R Project files
**/.Rproj.user
**/.RData
**/.Rhistory

# Execution and Log files
**/*.err
**/*.out

# Specific Notebooks
test_merge.ipynb


